{"path":"chrono/duration/count","title":"std::chrono::duration<Rep,Period>::count","titleHtml":"<span class=\"t-title-prefix\">std::chrono::duration&lt;Rep,Period&gt;::</span>count","originalUrl":"https://en.cppreference.com/w/cpp/chrono/duration/count","section":"chrono","kind":"page","summary":"Returns the number of ticks for this duration.","html":"<table class=\"t-dcl-begin\"><tbody>\n<tr class=\"t-dcl t-since-cxx11\">\n<td> <div><span class=\"mw-geshi cpp source-cpp\"><span class=\"kw4\">constexpr</span> rep count<span class=\"br0\">(</span><span class=\"br0\">)</span> <span class=\"kw4\">const</span><span class=\"sy4\">;</span></span></div></td>\n<td class=\"t-dcl-nopad\">  </td>\n<td> <span class=\"t-mark-rev t-since-cxx11\">(since C++11)</span> </td>\n</tr>\n<tr class=\"t-dcl-sep\"><td></td><td></td><td></td></tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p>Returns the number of ticks for this duration.\n</p>\n<h3 id=\"Parameters\">Parameters</h3>\n<p>(none)\n</p>\n<h3 id=\"Return_value\">Return value</h3>\n<p>The number of ticks for this duration.\n</p>\n<h3 id=\"Example\">Example</h3>\n<div class=\"t-example\">\n<pre data-lang=\"cpp\"><code><span class=\"co2\">#include &lt;chrono&gt;</span>\n<span class=\"co2\">#include &lt;iostream&gt;</span>\n&nbsp;\n<span class=\"kw4\">int</span> main<span class=\"br0\">(</span><span class=\"br0\">)</span>\n<span class=\"br0\">{</span>\n    <a href=\"/w/cpp/chrono/duration\"><span class=\"kw1000\">std::<span class=\"me2\">chrono</span><span class=\"sy4\">::</span><span class=\"me2\">milliseconds</span></span></a> ms<span class=\"br0\">{</span><span class=\"nu0\">3</span><span class=\"br0\">}</span><span class=\"sy4\">;</span> <span class=\"co1\">// 3 milliseconds</span>\n    <span class=\"co1\">// 6000 microseconds constructed from 3 milliseconds</span>\n    <a href=\"/w/cpp/chrono/duration\"><span class=\"kw999\">std::<span class=\"me2\">chrono</span><span class=\"sy4\">::</span><span class=\"me2\">microseconds</span></span></a> us <span class=\"sy1\">=</span> <span class=\"nu0\">2</span> <span class=\"sy2\">*</span> ms<span class=\"sy4\">;</span>\n    <span class=\"co1\">// 30Hz clock using fractional ticks</span>\n    <a href=\"/w/cpp/chrono/duration\"><span class=\"kw997\">std::<span class=\"me2\">chrono</span><span class=\"sy4\">::</span><span class=\"me2\">duration</span></span></a><span class=\"sy1\">&lt;</span><span class=\"kw4\">double</span>, <a href=\"/w/cpp/numeric/ratio/ratio\"><span class=\"kw1533\">std::<span class=\"me2\">ratio</span></span></a><span class=\"sy1\">&lt;</span><span class=\"nu0\">1</span>, <span class=\"nu0\">30</span><span class=\"sy1\">&gt;&gt;</span> hz30<span class=\"br0\">(</span><span class=\"nu16\">3.5</span><span class=\"br0\">)</span><span class=\"sy4\">;</span>\n&nbsp;\n    <a href=\"/w/cpp/io/cout\"><span class=\"kw1775\">std::<span class=\"me2\">cout</span></span></a> <span class=\"sy1\">&lt;&lt;</span> <span class=\"st0\">\"3 ms duration has \"</span> <span class=\"sy1\">&lt;&lt;</span> ms.<span class=\"me1\">count</span><span class=\"br0\">(</span><span class=\"br0\">)</span> <span class=\"sy1\">&lt;&lt;</span> <span class=\"st0\">\" ticks<span class=\"es1\">\\n</span>\"</span>\n              <span class=\"sy1\">&lt;&lt;</span> <span class=\"st0\">\"6000 us duration has \"</span> <span class=\"sy1\">&lt;&lt;</span> us.<span class=\"me1\">count</span><span class=\"br0\">(</span><span class=\"br0\">)</span> <span class=\"sy1\">&lt;&lt;</span> <span class=\"st0\">\" ticks<span class=\"es1\">\\n</span>\"</span>\n              <span class=\"sy1\">&lt;&lt;</span> <span class=\"st0\">\"3.5 30Hz duration has \"</span> <span class=\"sy1\">&lt;&lt;</span> hz30.<span class=\"me1\">count</span><span class=\"br0\">(</span><span class=\"br0\">)</span> <span class=\"sy1\">&lt;&lt;</span> <span class=\"st0\">\" ticks<span class=\"es1\">\\n</span>\"</span><span class=\"sy4\">;</span>       \n<span class=\"br0\">}</span></code></pre>\n<p>Output:\n</p>\n<pre data-output=\"1\"><code>3 ms duration has 3 ticks\n6000 us duration has 6000 ticks\n3.5 30Hz duration has 3.5 ticks</code></pre> \n</div>\n<h3 id=\"See_also\">See also</h3>\n<table class=\"t-dsc-begin\">\n<tr class=\"t-dsc\">\n<td>  <div class=\"t-dsc-member-div\"><div><a href=\"/w/cpp/chrono/duration/duration_cast\"> <span class=\"t-lines\"><span>duration_cast</span></span></a></div><div><span class=\"t-lines\"><span><span class=\"t-mark-rev t-since-cxx11\">(C++11)</span></span></span></div></div>\n</td>\n<td>  converts a duration to another, with a different tick interval <br> <span class=\"t-mark\">(function template)</span> </td></tr>\n</table>","headings":[{"depth":3,"text":"Parameters","id":"Parameters"},{"depth":3,"text":"Return value","id":"Return_value"},{"depth":3,"text":"Example","id":"Example"},{"depth":3,"text":"See also","id":"See_also"}],"breadcrumbs":[{"path":"","title":"C++ reference"},{"path":"chrono","title":"Date and time utilities"},{"path":"chrono/duration","title":"std::chrono::duration"}],"children":[],"map":{"label":"std::chrono::duration<Rep,Period>::count","children":[{"label":"Declarations","note":"1 declaration; revisions: since C++11. Returns the number of ticks for this duration."},{"label":"Parameters","note":"(none)"},{"label":"Return value","note":"The number of ticks for this duration."},{"label":"Example"},{"label":"See also","children":[{"label":"duration_cast","note":"converts a duration to another, with a different tick interval"}]}]},"standards":["C++11"],"wordCount":130,"codeBlockCount":2}
